1d:["$","p","27",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Click-Through Rates (CTR)"}],": Abandoned cart emails generate ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"12.7% CTR"}],", versus ",["$","strong","5",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"2.3%"}]," for standard promotional blasts (Klaviyo, 2023)."]}]
1e:["$","p","28",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Revenue Impact"}],": Brands using behavioral triggers (e.g., browse abandonment, post-purchase upsell) see ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"3x higher revenue per email"}]," than batch-and-blast campaigns (Mailchimp, 2023 State of Marketing Report)."]}]
1f:["$","p","30",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Why such a gap? *Relevance + timing*. A welcome email sent 5 minutes after sign-up capitalizes on peak user intent. A generic \"Top 10 Products\" newsletter sent Tuesday at 10 a.m. does not."]}]
20:["$","hr","32",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}]
21:["$","h2","34",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"✅ Best Practices: Triggered Emails"}]
22:["$","h3","36",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-8 mb-3","children":"1. **Keep It Pure -- No Sneaky Marketing**"}]
23:["$","p","37",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["> ❌ Don't embed 3 promo banners in your password reset email."]}]
24:["$","p","38",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["> ✅ Do include *one* contextual, value-add link (e.g., \"Need help? Visit our Help Center\")."]}]
25:["$","p","40",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["The FTC warns that adding \"commercial content\" to otherwise transactional messages can void the CAN-SPAM exemption--exposing you to fines up to ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"$$51,744 per violation"}],"."]}]
26:["$","h3","42",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-8 mb-3","children":"2. **Optimize for Mobile & Speed**"}]
27:["$","p","43",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- 62% of triggered emails are opened on mobile (Litmus, 2024). Use single-column layouts, large tap targets (>44px), and load in <2 seconds."]}]
28:["$","p","44",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Test deliverability across Gmail, Outlook, and Apple Mail--use tools like [Email on Acid](https://www.emailonacid.com/) or [Litmus](https://www.litmus.com/)."]}]
29:["$","h3","46",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-8 mb-3","children":"3. **Leverage Dynamic Personalization**"}]
2a:["$","p","47",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Go beyond `{{first_name}}`. Pull real-time data:"]}]
2b:["$","p","48",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- \"Your order of *Wireless Earbuds (Black)* shipped today via FedEx -- track here.\""]}]
2c:["$","p","49",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- \"You've earned 245 points! Redeem them before they expire in 7 days.\""]}]
2d:["$","p","51",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["👉 *Actionable Tip*: Use your CRM or e-commerce platform (Shopify, Salesforce, HubSpot) to sync inventory status, shipping carrier, and loyalty tier--then inject into templates."]}]
2e:["$","hr","53",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}]
2f:["$","h2","55",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"✅ Best Practices: Marketing Emails"}]
30:["$","h3","57",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-8 mb-3","children":"1. **Segment Relentlessly**"}]
31:["$","p","58",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Only 24% of marketers segment campaigns *beyond* basic demographics (HubSpot, 2024). Yet segmented campaigns drive ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"760% more revenue"}]," than non-segmented ones (Campaign Monitor)."]}]
32:["$","p","60",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["✅ Segment by:"]}]
33:["$","p","61",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Behavior (e.g., clicked \"Pricing\" but didn't convert)"]}]
34:["$","p","62",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Lifecycle stage (new lead vs. lapsed customer)"]}]
35:["$","p","63",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Purchase frequency + average order value (AOV)"]}]
36:["$","h3","65",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-8 mb-3","children":"2. **Respect the \"Frequency Floor\"**"}]
37:["$","p","66",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Sending >2 marketing emails/week without clear value increases unsubscribe rates by ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"47%"}]," (Omnisend). Instead:"]}]
38:["$","p","67",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Use preference centers to let subscribers choose cadence & topics"]}]
39:["$","p","68",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Auto-suppress inactive users (no opens/clicks in 90 days)"]}]
3a:["$","h3","70",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-8 mb-3","children":"3. **Design for Scannability & Action**"}]
3b:["$","p","71",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Place primary CTA above the fold"]}]
3c:["$","p","72",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Use bullet points--not paragraphs--to highlight benefits"]}]
3d:["$","p","73",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Include alt text for every image and semantic HTML for accessibility"]}]
3e:["$","p","75",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["👉 *Pro Tip*: Run A/B tests on *subject lines* (e.g., emoji vs. no emoji) and *CTA copy* (\"Get My Discount\" vs. \"Unlock 25% Off\"). Even small lifts compound: a 0.5% CTR increase on a 100K list = ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"500 extra clicks per send"}],"."]}]
3f:["$","hr","77",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}]
40:["$","h2","79",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"🚫 What *Not* to Do (Ever)"}]
41:["$","p","81",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Don't repurpose transactional templates for marketing"}]," -- it confuses algorithms and users."]}]
42:["$","p","82",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Don't ignore suppression lists"}]," -- sending to hard bounces or unsubscribes violates laws and tanks domain reputation."]}]
43:["$","p","83",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Don't skip authentication"}]," -- implement SPF, DKIM, and DMARC. 83% of domains lacking DMARC fail inbox placement tests (Valimail, 2024)."]}]
44:["$","hr","85",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}]
45:["$","h2","87",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"💡 Final Thought: Think Like a Conversation, Not a Broadcast"}]
46:["$","p","89",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Triggered emails are your brand's *\"Yes, I heard you\"* moments -- fast, accurate, and human."]}]
47:["$","p","90",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Marketing emails are your *\"Here's why you'll love us even more\"* story -- thoughtful, strategic, and empathetic."]}]
48:["$","p","92",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Master both--not as competing tactics, but as complementary voices in a unified customer journey."]}]
49:["$","p","94",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Start this week"}],": Audit your last 5 triggered emails. Are they truly transactional? Then review your last 3 marketing sends: Did segmentation and personalization drive the message--or just habit?"]}]
4a:["$","p","96",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Because in email, relevance isn't a nice-to-have."]}]
4b:["$","p","97",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["It's the difference between being *opened*... and being *ignored*."]}]
